{"author":{"id":"2462ded6f56967dde059994c39a506c79e39e5dfd10c5a07f07a23a5652a8353"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1776874031,"nonce":"hiPxzKzWjjE8OZNjV6BHAWvb5pk=","title":"Codex sessions don't report usage/cost","message":"## Problem\n\nCodex sessions report zero usage because `@@DONE@@` is emitted before `turn.completed` (which contains usage data). The previous fix (b7e7dee7b0bd) conflicted with the provider-overload fix.\n\n## Solution\n\nBuffer `@@DONE@@` until `turn.completed` arrives:\n\n1. Add `_pending_done_raw: str | None` to `CodexAgent`\n2. When `@@DONE@@` appears in `agent_message` or MCP signal, buffer it (do not emit)\n3. When `turn.completed` arrives, emit buffered `@@DONE@@` with usage metadata\n4. If process exits without `turn.completed`, emit buffered `@@DONE@@` without usage\n\n## Files to modify\n\n- `adapters/agents/codex.py`:\n  - Add `_pending_done_raw` field\n  - Modify `_parse_item` for agent_message: buffer @@DONE@@ instead of emitting\n  - Modify `_parse_mcp_signal` for nightshift_done: buffer instead of emitting\n  - Modify `_parse_toplevel` for turn.completed: use buffered raw if present\n  - Add `_on_process_exit` to emit buffered @@DONE@@ if stream ends early\n\n## Tests\n\n- `test_usage_captured_before_done_marker` - agent_message with @@DONE@@ waits for turn.completed\n- `test_usage_from_turn_completed_after_mcp_done` - MCP nightshift_done waits for turn.completed\n- `test_buffered_done_emitted_on_process_exit` - stream ends before turn.completed\n- `test_no_buffered_done_on_normal_turn_completed` - no prior @@DONE@@\n- `test_before_stream_clears_pending_done` - state reset between runs\n\n## IMPORTANT\n\nDo NOT revert any existing code. Build on top of current master which has:\n- `_is_overload_exhausted()` check in error handling\n- `_parse_text_markers()` fallback in agent_message handling\n\nREQ: REQ-032","files":null}]}